# AWSM Strategy Tool — Tester Guide

Welcome. You've been invited to test the AWSM Strategy Tool — an AI-powered strategy assistant built on AWSM's proprietary advertising strategy framework. This guide walks you through setup and how to get the most out of it.

---

## What This Is

The AWSM Strategy Tool is a thinking partner for advertising and brand strategy work. It runs a full strategy chain — from reading a client brief through to a master handoff document for your execution team. It is built to produce work at the standard of a senior strategist, not a generic AI assistant.

It is not a content generator. It is not a template filler. It is a rigorous strategic thinking partner that asks hard questions, surfaces tensions, and pushes toward platforms that actually work in market.

---

## What You Need

- A **Claude Pro account** (claude.ai — the paid plan at $20/month)
- The **system prompt file** shared alongside this guide (`draper-system-prompt.md`)
- A client brief, RFP, or strategic problem you want to work through

If you don't have a Claude Pro account, you'll need to upgrade at claude.ai before proceeding. The tool requires Pro because it uses the Projects feature, which is not available on free accounts.

