## How to Start a Session

Inside your project, start a new chat. The tool is immediately active — you don't need to introduce yourself or explain what the tool is. Just begin working.

**To start a strategy session**, share a brief. You can paste it directly into the chat, describe the situation, or share a mix of both. The tool will read it and begin the strategy chain.

**Example opening messages:**

> "Here's a brief I've received from a client. Let's work through it."
> [paste brief]

> "I'm working on a brand strategy for a mid-range cooking oil in Uganda. The client is Brookside. Here's what I know about the situation..."

> "I need to develop a campaign platform for a telecom brand entering the youth market in Kenya. No formal brief yet — let me describe the situation."

The tool will take it from there.

